            "Mar 25, 2026", "Feature"),
        new("Resolved CSV import memory leak",
            "Fixed an issue where importing CSV files over 50MB caused memory usage to spike and the worker process to crash.",
            "Mar 23, 2026", "Fix"),
        new("Keyboard shortcut customization",
            "Remap any keyboard shortcut from the settings panel. Export and import keybinding profiles to share across team members.",
            "Mar 21, 2026", "Feature"),
        new("Optimized image pipeline",
            "Images uploaded to the asset library are now processed in parallel with AVIF and WebP generation, reducing upload-to-publish time by 55%.",
            "Mar 19, 2026", "Improvement"),
        new("Fixed duplicate webhook deliveries",
            "Webhook events were occasionally delivered twice during high-throughput periods. Added idempotency keys to prevent duplicates.",
            "Mar 17, 2026", "Fix"),
        new("Team activity feed",
            "View a real-time feed of team actions including deploys, config changes, and member invitations with filterable event types.",
            "Mar 15, 2026", "Feature"),
        new("Expanded API rate limit headers",
            "API responses now include X-RateLimit-Remaining, X-RateLimit-Reset, and X-RateLimit-Policy headers for better client-side handling.",
            "Mar 13, 2026", "Improvement"),
        new("Dark mode for email templates",
            "Transactional emails now detect the recipient system color scheme preference and render dark or light variants accordingly.",
            "Mar 11, 2026", "Feature"),
        new("Fixed search ranking regression",
            "Restored relevance scoring after a migration introduced equal weighting across all fields. Title matches now rank higher again.",
